  "foaf:name": "Caspian Sea Carbon Dioxide Removal Project (CaspianCDR)",
  "sdo:name": "Caspian Sea Carbon Dioxide Removal Project (CaspianCDR)",
  "sdo:description": "CaspianCDR is a research project to develop technology to remove carbon dioxide through the natural process of photosynthesis in the Caspian Sea. Our research was inspired by Briliant Planet&#x27;s innovative process to grow vast quantities of microalgae in open ponds on coastal desert land. This is achieved without the use of fresh water, by utilizing a natural process that contributes to healthier oceans and air.",
